  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You conjure a barrier with your innate magic that repels magic. You can cast <em>Energy Aegis</em> as a 7th rank innate Arcane spell, but only on yourself. In addition, while under its effects you increase or gain resistance 10 to damage that matches your selected elemental trait from you Drachiri Benefactor. If you have multiple traits selected from your Benefactor, this increase applies to them as well.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special</span></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> If you have the Exemplary Qualities feat, the resistance you gain increases to be equal to your level.</span></p>"
